{
    "note": "Claude Code 端到端演示剧本：前三条是 Bash 工具调用（只读轻量命令），让 agent 连续跑三轮工具循环；最后一条是纯文本回答（finish_reason stop → stop_reason end_turn），agent 收到后结束循环并把这句话打印出来。所以本剧本要配 --exhausted hold 用：即使意料之外地多来一次请求，拿到的也是同一条收尾回答。压测请用 scripts/perf-scenario.json + --exhausted loop。",
    "defaults": {
        "delayMs": 10,
        "chunkDelayMs": 1,
        "chunkSize": 4
    },
    "responses": [
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "先看一眼当前目录里有什么。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_claude_ls",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "Bash",
                            "arguments": { "command": "ls" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "再打印一行标记，确认工具链路是通的。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_claude_echo",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "Bash",
                            "arguments": { "command": "echo llm-mock-perf-tick" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "接下来确认工作目录的绝对路径。",
                "tool_calls": [
                    {
                        "id": "call_claude_pwd",
                        "type": "function",
                        "function": {
                            "name": "Bash",
                            "arguments": { "command": "pwd" }
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "finish_reason": "tool_calls"
        },
        {
            "message": {
                "role": "assistant",
                "content": "三轮工具调用都回来了：目录列表、标记回显与工作目录路径都正常，llm-mock 的 Anthropic Messages 链路验证结束。"
            },
            "finish_reason": "stop"
        }
    ]
}
